"Autorizasaun offline ba Investigadór. Admin hili data hahú no remata (mamuk "
"= loron 7). Bainhira remata, Investigadór labele kria kazu foun maibé bele "
"nafatin sinkron. Autorizasaun Ofisiál Legál iha modulu Legál → Ativa Input "
"Legál."
msgstr ""
"Offline authorisation for Investigators. Admin chooses the start and end "
"dates (empty = 7 days). When it ends, the Investigator cannot create new "
"cases but can still sync. Legal Officer authorisation is in the Legal module"
" → Activate Legal Input."

#: legal/templates/legal/autorizasaun.html
msgid ""
"Hili Ofisiál Legál ne'ebé bele input survei legál (online no app offline) no"
" data hahú–remata. Bainhira remata, butaun Input Legál subar automátiku."
msgstr ""
"Choose the Legal Officers who can enter legal surveys (online and offline "
"app) and the start and end dates. When it ends, the Legal Input button is "
"hidden automatically."

#: legal/views/autorizasaun_v.py
msgid "Input legál ativu ba Ofisiál Legál %(n)s to'o %(date)s."
msgstr "Legal input active for %(n)s Legal Officer(s) until %(date)s."

